DESCRIPTION >
    Reads complete hours from events_deductions_hourly_mv and exact raw edges for aggregate_on="deducted".
    Returns the finest grain the response needs — (period, balance, group_value) — and the server
    pivots it into values{} / balances[] / grouped_values{}. Both levels come from these rows:
    balances[] is the sum across group_value, grouped_values is the split.

    customer_id is REQUIRED. It leads the MV sorting key, so pinning it keeps every query on the key
    prefix instead of scanning the org. The server rejects the request before reaching this pipe.

    feature_ids matches EITHER side of the edge — a deduction is included if the tracked feature is
    in the list OR the balance's feature is. Passing a credit system's id therefore returns only what
    drew on that pool (nobody /tracks a credit system), while passing a normal feature returns every
    balance it touched.

    group_by is resolved from the EVENT for entity_id (a shared pool is a customer-level balance
    drawn by many entities, so the balance carries no entity of its own) and from the BALANCE
    for plan_id. Property grouping is not served here — this rollup carries no properties by design;
    the server routes those to the raw `events` path.

    Ranking is WINDOW-WIDE, not per bin. aggregate_groupable.pipe partitions its row_number by
    period, which means AUTUMN_RESERVED holds different members in every bucket — fine for a single
    total, wrong for a stacked series over time, where segments would appear and vanish between
    columns. Here the top N is chosen once across the whole window per balance, then applied
    identically to every bin.

TOKEN "aggregate_deductions_read" READ

NODE base
DESCRIPTION >
    Filter to one customer's deductions and project the period and grouping value.

    Property grouping reads raw events throughout the window because the rollup has no properties.
    Other queries combine complete hourly rollups with raw boundary events, scoped to one customer.
SQL >
    %
    {% set use_property = defined(property_key) and String(property_key, '') != '' %}
    WITH
        {% if use_property %}timestamp{% else %}toStartOfHour(timestamp){% end %} AS bin_timestamp,
        toDateTime({{ String(start_date, '2024-01-01 00:00:00') }}) AS window_start,
        toDateTime({{ String(end_date, '2024-12-31 23:59:59') }}) AS window_end,
        if(window_start = toStartOfHour(window_start), toStartOfHour(window_start), addHours(toStartOfHour(window_start), 1)) AS full_hours_start,
        toStartOfHour(window_end) AS full_hours_end
    SELECT
        {% if String(bin_size, 'day') == 'hour' %}
        {% if use_property %}
        formatDateTime(toStartOfHour(timestamp, {{ String(timezone, 'UTC') }}), '%F %T') as period,
        {% else %}
        formatDateTime(toStartOfHour(timestamp), '%F %T') as period,
        {% end %}
        {% elif String(bin_size, 'day') == 'month' %}
        formatDateTime(toStartOfMonth(bin_timestamp, {{ String(timezone, 'UTC') }}), '%F %T') as period,
        {% elif String(bin_size, 'day') == 'week' %}
        formatDateTime(toStartOfWeek(bin_timestamp, 1, {{ String(timezone, 'UTC') }}), '%F %T') as period,
        {% else %}
        formatDateTime(toStartOfDay(bin_timestamp, {{ String(timezone, 'UTC') }}), '%F %T') as period,
        {% end %}
        JSONExtractString(JSONExtractString(d), 'feature_id') as balance_feature_id,
        JSONExtractString(JSONExtractString(d), 'balance_id') as balance_id,
        JSONExtractString(JSONExtractString(d), 'plan_id') as plan_id,
        JSONExtractString(
            JSONExtractRaw(JSONExtractString(d), 'reset'),
            'interval'
        ) as reset_interval,
        {% if use_property %}
        {{ column('properties.' + String(property_key, '')) }}::String as group_value,
        {% elif String(group_column, '') == 'entity_id' %}
        coalesce(entity_id, '') as group_value,
        {% elif String(group_column, '') == 'source_feature_id' %}
        event_name as group_value,
        {% elif String(group_column, '') == 'plan_id' %}
        JSONExtractString(JSONExtractString(d), 'plan_id') as group_value,
        {% else %}
        '' as group_value,
        {% end %}
        sum(JSONExtractFloat(JSONExtractString(d), 'value')) as deducted,
        count() as deduction_count
    FROM events
    ARRAY JOIN JSONExtractArrayRaw(toString(deductions), 'list') as d
    WHERE
        org_id = {{ String(org_id, '') }}
        AND env = {{ String(env, 'test') }}
        AND customer_id = {{ String(customer_id, '') }}
        AND timestamp >= window_start AND timestamp <= window_end
        {% if not use_property %}
        AND (timestamp < full_hours_start OR timestamp >= full_hours_end)
        {% if String(group_column, '') == 'entity_id' %}
        AND coalesce(entity_id, '') != ''
        {% end %}
        {% end %}
        AND JSONExtractString(JSONExtractString(d), 'balance_id') != ''
        {% if defined(feature_ids) %}
        AND (
            event_name IN {{ Array(feature_ids, 'String', default='[]') }}
            OR JSONExtractString(JSONExtractString(d), 'feature_id') IN {{ Array(feature_ids, 'String', default='[]') }}
        )
        {% end %}
        {% if defined(entity_id) and String(entity_id, '') != '' %}
        AND entity_id = {{ String(entity_id) }}
        {% end %}
    GROUP BY
        period,
        balance_feature_id,
        balance_id,
        plan_id,
        reset_interval,
        group_value
    {% if not use_property %}
    UNION ALL
    SELECT
        {% if String(bin_size, 'day') == 'hour' %}
        formatDateTime(hour, '%F %T') as period,
        {% elif String(bin_size, 'day') == 'month' %}
        formatDateTime(toStartOfMonth(hour, {{ String(timezone, 'UTC') }}), '%F %T') as period,
        {% elif String(bin_size, 'day') == 'week' %}
        formatDateTime(toStartOfWeek(hour, 1, {{ String(timezone, 'UTC') }}), '%F %T') as period,
        {% else %}
        formatDateTime(toStartOfDay(hour, {{ String(timezone, 'UTC') }}), '%F %T') as period,
        {% end %}
        balance_feature_id,
        balance_id,
        plan_id,
        reset_interval,
        {% if String(group_column, '') == 'entity_id' %}
        entity_id as group_value,
        {% elif String(group_column, '') == 'source_feature_id' %}
        event_name as group_value,
        {% elif String(group_column, '') == 'plan_id' %}
        plan_id as group_value,
        {% else %}
        '' as group_value,
        {% end %}
        sum(deducted) as deducted,
        sum(deduction_count) as deduction_count
    FROM events_deductions_hourly_mv
    WHERE
        org_id = {{ String(org_id, '') }}
        AND env = {{ String(env, 'test') }}
        AND customer_id = {{ String(customer_id, '') }}
        AND hour >= full_hours_start AND hour < full_hours_end
        {% if defined(feature_ids) %}
        AND (
            event_name IN {{ Array(feature_ids, 'String', default='[]') }}
            OR balance_feature_id IN {{ Array(feature_ids, 'String', default='[]') }}
        )
        {% end %}
        {% if defined(entity_id) and String(entity_id, '') != '' %}
        AND entity_id = {{ String(entity_id) }}
        {% end %}
        {% if String(group_column, '') == 'entity_id' %}
        AND entity_id != ''
        {% end %}
    GROUP BY
        period,
        balance_feature_id,
        balance_id,
        plan_id,
        reset_interval,
        group_value
    {% end %}

NODE window_ranked
DESCRIPTION >
    Rank each balance's groups by their total over the WHOLE window, so the same set of groups is
    kept in every bin. Ungrouped queries collapse to a single '' group and rank 1.
SQL >
    SELECT
        balance_id,
        group_value,
        row_number() OVER (
            PARTITION BY balance_id
            ORDER BY sum(deducted) DESC, group_value ASC
        ) as rn
    FROM base
    GROUP BY balance_id, group_value

NODE endpoint
TYPE endpoint
DESCRIPTION >
    Fold everything outside the top N into AUTUMN_RESERVED, using the window-wide ranking.
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        base.period as period,
        base.balance_feature_id as balance_feature_id,
        base.balance_id as balance_id,
        base.plan_id as plan_id,
        base.reset_interval as reset_interval,
        if(
            window_ranked.rn <= {{ Int32(max_groups, 9) }},
            base.group_value,
            'AUTUMN_RESERVED'
        ) as group_value,
        sum(base.deducted) as deducted,
        sum(base.deduction_count) as deduction_count,
        max(window_ranked.rn) > {{ Int32(max_groups, 9) }} as _truncated
    FROM base
    INNER JOIN window_ranked
        ON base.balance_id = window_ranked.balance_id
        AND base.group_value = window_ranked.group_value
    GROUP BY
        period,
        balance_feature_id,
        balance_id,
        plan_id,
        reset_interval,
        group_value
    ORDER BY
        period,
        balance_feature_id,
        balance_id,
        group_value
